# The extension's signing key. The PUBLIC half is committed, in
# packages/browser/src/manifest.config.ts, because pinning the extension ID is
# the whole point of it. The private half signs a .crx and is needed for
# nothing else here — Chrome Web Store signs its own — so it stays out of the
# repo rather than being a secret everyone with a clone holds.
packages/browser/.keys/
